{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-2pe-3-1","title":"2 Peter 3:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2PE","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 He assures them of the certainty of Christ's coming to judgment, against those scorners who dispute against it; 8 warning the godly, for the long patience of God, to hasten their repentance. 10 He describes also the manner how the world shall be destroyed; 11 exhorting them, from the expectation thereof, to all holiness of life; 16 and again to think the patience of God to tend to their salvation, as Paul wrote to them in his epistles.</p>\n<p>second epistle. 2Co 13:2; 1Pe 1:1,2 I stir. 1:13-15; 2Ti 1:6 pure. Ps 24:4; 73:1; Mt 5:8; 1Ti 5:22; 1Pe 1:22 way. 1:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2pe-3-2","title":"2 Peter 3:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2PE","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>ye may. 1:19-21; Lu 1:70; 24:27,44; Ac 3:18,24-26; 10:43; 28:23; 1Pe 1:10-12 Re 19:10 and of. 15; 2:21; Eph 2:20; 1Jo 4:6; Jude 1:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2pe-3-3","title":"2 Peter 3:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2PE","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>that there. 1Ti 4:1,2; 2Ti 3:1; 1Jo 2:18; Jude 1:18 scoffers. Pr 1:22; 3:34; 14:6; Isa 5:19; 28:14; 29:20; Ho 7:5 walking. 2:10; 2Co 4:2; Jude 1:16,18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2pe-3-4","title":"2 Peter 3:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2PE","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>where. Ge 19:14; Ec 1:9; 8:11; Isa 5:18,19; Jer 5:12,13; 17:15 Eze 12:22-27; Mal 2:17; Mt 24:28; Lu 12:45 from the beginning. Mr 13:19; Re 3:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2pe-3-5","title":"2 Peter 3:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2PE","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>they willingly. Pr 17:16; Joh 3:19,20; Ro 1:28; 2Th 2:10-12 by the word. Ge 1:6,9; Ps 24:2; 33:6; 136:6; Heb 11:3 standing. Gr. consisting. Col 1:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2pe-3-6","title":"2 Peter 3:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2PE","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>2:5; Ge 7:10-23; 9:15; Job 12:15; Mt 24:38,39; Lu 17:27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2pe-3-7","title":"2 Peter 3:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2PE","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>the heavens. 10; Ps 50:3; 102:26; Isa 51:6; Zep 3:8; Mt 24:35; 25:41; 2Th 1:8 Re 20:11; 21:1 against. 2:9; Mt 10:15; 11:22,24; 12:36; Mr 6:11; 1Jo 4:17 and perdition. Ro 2:5; Php 1:28; 2Th 2:3; 1Ti 6:9; Re 17:8,11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2pe-3-8","title":"2 Peter 3:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2PE","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>be not. Ro 11:25; 1Co 10:1; 12:1 that one. Ps 90:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2pe-3-9","title":"2 Peter 3:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2PE","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>is not. Isa 46:13; Hab 2:3; Lu 18:7,8; Heb 10:37 but is. 15; Ex 34:6; Ps 86:15; Isa 30:18; Ro 9:22; 1Ti 1:16; 1Pe 3:20 not willing. Ex 18:23; 32:32; 33:11 but that. Ro 2:4; 1Ti 2:4; Re 2:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2pe-3-10","title":"2 Peter 3:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2PE","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>the day. Isa 2:12; Joe 1:15; 2:1,31; 3:14; Mal 4:5; 1Co 5:5; 2Co 1:14; Jude 1:6 as a. Mt 24:42,43; Lu 12:39; 1Th 5:2; Re 3:3; 16:15 in the which. Ps 102:26; Isa 51:6; Mt 24:35; Mr 13:31; Ro 8:20; Heb 1:11,12 Re 20:11; 21:1 the elements. 12 melt. Ps 46:6; 97:5; Am 9:5,13; Na 1:5 the earth. 7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2pe-3-11","title":"2 Peter 3:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2PE","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>all these. 12; Ps 75:3; Isa 14:31; 